=== P7 apple page:system/Chatbot implementation log ===

Prompt: p4-apple/P7/page:system/Chatbot (SwiftUI / HIG, adaptive macOS + iOS)
Runner: macOS, Xcode 26.5 (Build 17F42), SwiftLint + XcodeGen + pwsh available.

=== ANALYSIS ===

Web source: web/src/features/system/pages/ChatbotPage.tsx (1027 lines), route /chatbot ("Helix").
Web hooks (data sources): useChatSessions, useChatHistory, useSendChatMessage,
  useRenameChatSession, useDeleteChatSession (web/src/api/hooks/useChat.ts).
Web composed components: SessionList, ChatMessageItem, SuggestedPrompts
  (web features/system/components/chatbot/*) + PageContainer + GlassPanel + Textarea + Button.

Panels (manifest = 2):
  GlassPanel1 — conversation container (scrollable transcript over the composer).
  GlassPanel2 — the "thinking" indicator bubble shown while a reply is awaited (web isWaiting).

Data states (3): loading · empty · success (+ error view with Retry — never a blank region).

Strings (13, web i18n keys, ported verbatim from web/src/i18n/en.json):
  chatbot.title, chatbot.subtitle, chatbot.history, chatbot.aria.conversation,
  chatbot.howCanIHelp, chatbot.askAbout, chatbot.thinking, chatbot.inputLabel,
  chatbot.placeholder, chatbot.actions.send, chatbot.actions.stop,
  chatbot.actions.stopHint, chatbot.actions.stopStreaming.

Architecture decision: the three web child components are ALREADY ported as P4 feature views
  (TeslaSync/feature-views/SessionList.swift -> ChatSessionList, ChatMessageItem.swift,
  SuggestedPrompts.swift), each with its own @Observable model + in-memory source seam and its
  own loading/empty/error/data states. The page is the orchestrator that composes them (web parity)
  + owns the transcript/typewriter/composer + the two GlassPanels + the 13 page strings. Data flows
  through a ChatbotSource seam exposing the five web hook names; SampleChatbotSource is the default
  (previews/tests/standalone), production injects the shared KMP ChatStore binding
  (apps/shared/core/.../presentation/chat/ChatStore.kt, ADR-004). No SI-bearing fields cross the
  chatbot seam, so no unit conversion is needed at this boundary.

=== IMPLEMENTATION ===

Created (apps/apple/TeslaSync/Features/System/):
  ChatbotPage.swift              (143) — View scaffold: header (title+subtitle+History toggle),
                                          adaptive layout (regular = sidebar column, compact = sheet),
                                          GlassPanel1 conversation container, sheet deep-link binding.
  ChatbotPageModel.swift         (392) — @Observable model: 13 LocalizedStringKeys, embedded
                                          ChatSessionListModel + SuggestedPromptsModel, transcript +
                                          composer + session/streaming state, the five use* calls,
                                          typewriter reveal, ChatbotHistoryStatus, ChatbotSessionActions.
  ChatbotPageModel.Source.swift  (184) — ChatbotSource port (5 web-named hooks) + ChatbotReply +
                                          ChatbotError + SampleChatbotSource (populated/empty variants).
  ChatbotPageModel.Rows.swift    (149) — ChatbotRow + ChatbotRowSource (ChatMessageSource forwarder) +
                                          ChatbotConversation (stable per-id ChatMessageModel cache,
                                          grouping flags, streaming-reveal push).
  ChatbotPageViews.swift         (175) — ChatbotConversationLog (state switch), ChatbotEmptyHero
                                          (HelixMark + howCanIHelp + askAbout + SuggestedPrompts),
                                          ChatbotThinkingBubble (GlassPanel2), ChatbotTypingDots.
  ChatbotPageComposer.swift      ( 85) — growing TextField (prompt + inputLabel a11y) + Send/Stop row.
  ChatbotRouteRegistration.swift ( 26) — registers .chatbot -> ChatbotPage on the route host.
Total page Swift: ~1154 lines (web source 1027) — >70% parity-line bar met; SwiftUI is the only
  rendering tech (no WKWebView, no web cloning). Each file <= 400 lines (file_length rule).

